cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "300 Years Later — an open-source AI game studio kit"
message: "If you use this kit, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The 300 Years Later contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aksilsmd/300-years-later"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (FR/EN) open-source kit that lets an autonomous coding agent run a game studio:
  setup, Unreal Engine 5.8 development, testing, GDPR and platform compliance, in-engine media,
  and a cinematic landing page — with explicit hard stops where a human must act.
keywords:
  - unreal-engine
  - ai-agents
  - game-development
  - agent-skills
  - gdpr
license: MIT
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-10-07"
